	"Nara... if they take my name, keep the shape of it.": "奈良……若他们夺走我的名字，请替我记住它的形状。",
	"I woke beneath the Grand Archive with a blade in my hand and my sister's voice trapped inside it.": "我在大档案馆下方醒来，手里握着一把刀，姐姐的声音被困在刀中。",
