	"I did. Before I became your blade, they called me the First Author.": "是我。在成为你的刀之前，他们称我为初代作者。",
	"The thing ahead is the ending I tore away: my hunger to make a flawless world.": "前方之物，是我亲手撕掉的结局——那个渴望创造无瑕世界的自己。",
	"Perfection is only a page where nobody was allowed to leave a mark.": "所谓完美，不过是一页不准任何人留下笔迹的纸。",
