	"A painless lie is still an erasure. I choose the messy truth.": "没有痛苦的谎言仍是抹除。我选择杂乱的真相。",
	"The blank page can restore every stolen memory—or dissolve the Archive forever.": "空白之页能恢复所有被盗的记忆——也能让档案馆永远消解。",
	"There is no perfect ending. There is only the cost you choose to remember.": "没有完美的结局，只有你选择铭记的代价。",
	"Then let the final mark be mine.": "那就让我落下最后一笔。",
	"PRESERVE THE SCARS": "保留伤痕",
