	"BREAK THE BINDING": "斩断装订",
	"Free every memory, even if the old world ends.": "释放所有记忆，即使旧世界因此终结。",
	"We restored the memories with every stain intact. The city grieved, argued, forgave—and became real again.": "我们恢复了记忆，也保留了每一处污痕。城市悲恸、争吵、宽恕——终于再次真实。",
	"The Archive no longer decides what is worthy. Anyone may write in its margins.": "档案馆不再裁定何者值得留存。任何人都能在页边写下自己的话。",
	"I became an ordinary sword. It was the kindest ending an author could receive.": "我成了一把普通的刀。这是一个作者所能得到的最温柔结局。",
	"There are still masks beyond the final shelf. Tomorrow, we bring them home too.": "最后一排书架之外仍有面具。明天，我们也带他们回家。",
	"I broke the binding. The Archive fell upward in a storm of names, recipes, crimes, lullabies, and unfinished goodbyes.": "我斩断了装订。档案馆在姓名、菜谱、罪行、摇篮曲与未尽告别的风暴中向天空坠落。",
